chapter.v:
Now therefore 


let your, 


hands be strong, and be valiant, for Saul your lord is dead, and the house of Judah has anointed me king over them.” Ish-bosheth Made King of Israel

Joab returned 


from the, 


pursuit of Abner. And when he had gathered all the people together, there were missing from David’s servants nineteen men besides Asahel.
